    {
      "id": "2u0w4sX9bYLSh_gdyUqE3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 267.5908882179858,
      "y": 2318.582443336212,
      "width": 396,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 864472802,
      "version": 385,
      "versionNonce": 2136204675,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772349080078,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "while(i<=mid&&j<=r){\n  // 把较小的元素赋值到tmp数组\n  if (q[i]<=q[j]) tmp[k++] = q[i++];\n  else tmp[k++] = q[j++];\n}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "while(i<=mid&&j<=r){\n  // 把较小的元素赋值到tmp数组\n  if (q[i]<=q[j]) tmp[k++] = q[i++];\n  else tmp[k++] = q[j++];\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RfxT0FibiX2tS22-IH2Cw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 268.5534261009374,
      "y": 2446.2712915438346,
      "width": 453.8548278808594,
      "height": 38.52844460521925,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bG2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1126618686,
      "version": 326,
      "versionNonce": 1013540909,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772349080078,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果左半边有剩余(i<=mid)，就把左半边剩余元素拼接到tmp后面。\n否则，就把右半边剩余元素拼接到tmp后面",
      "fontSize": 15.411377842087699,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果左半边有剩余(i<=mid)，就把左半边剩余元素拼接到tmp后面。\n否则，就把右半边剩余元素拼接到tmp后面",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yqdpG5KqVtljxAZL1tIxY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 267.84271993902166,
      "y": 2495.944407050017,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bG3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1329468002,
      "version": 154,
      "versionNonce": 660749603,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772349080078,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "while (i <= mid) tmp[k++] = q[i++];\nwhile (j <= r) tmp[k++] = q[j++];",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "while (i <= mid) tmp[k++] = q[i++];\nwhile (j <= r) tmp[k++] = q[j++];",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZwYnj-JmGcdHvc4KVzZPK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 268.3598145817292,
      "y": 2569.438464466129,
      "width": 484,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bG4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 334352830,
      "version": 136,
      "versionNonce": 616946317,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772349080078,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "把tmp数组的元素复制给q数组\nfor (int i=l,j=0;i<=r;i++.j++) q[i]=tmp[j]; ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "把tmp数组的元素复制给q数组\nfor (int i=l,j=0;i<=r;i++.j++) q[i]=tmp[j]; ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
