      "text": "如何计算（x1,y1)到（x2,y2）的区域内所有数的和？",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如何计算（x1,y1)到（x2,y2）的区域内所有数的和？",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VOkrJQyDETrf9GvSWJfcx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 293.94286237444203,
      "y": 794.1999947684152,
      "width": 3.7599945068359375,
