      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1772355099382,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "二维前缀和：已知原矩阵 a，求前缀和矩阵 s，其中 s[i][j]表示从 (0,0)到 (i,j)的矩形区域和。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "二维前缀和：已知原矩阵 a，求前缀和矩阵 s，其中 s[i][j]表示从 (0,0)到 (i,j)的矩形区域和。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cP_-Ve5bbobSLZaA0euRn",
